<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-YIELDS EASE ON 91-DAY T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-YIELDS EASE ON 91-DAY T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields fell on 91-day</p>
<p>Lithuanian T-bills at Monday's auction although the 50 million</p>
<p>litas issue was undersubscribed, the country's central bank</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV.YIELD  LAST  MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p>91-days    8.30     8.36  7.60/8.76  50   34.672 28.502</p>
<p>The settlement date is June 19 and the bills mature on</p>
<p>September 18.</p>
<p>The next auction is on Tuesday when 50 million litas of</p>
<p>182-day paper will be offered.</p>
<p>-- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
